Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\Nthen we'll make some waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted. Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\Nthen you're a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\Nand freedom is the only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day,\Ncause that's just our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece. I'll be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it. Be so bad, so good first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just wasting time. Yes, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, they'll kill father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way so I can go\Nand kick this horny guy's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't listening at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me finish speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how would you describe\Nthe relationship between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it is a simple matter for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,our two peoples have been struggling to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,establish such a\Nrelationship for decades now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I left you a message\Nsaying not to fight Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,because I didn't want you\Nfacing him recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of how the fishman will view you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you rush in and show\Naggression towards Carrot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be viewed as nothing more than just\Nanother human bully oppressing our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you should be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One that saves the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, because we're pirates! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Heroes are great, but I'm not one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, do you even know\Nwhat you're asking me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say there's a chunk of meat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates will have a\Nbanquet and dig right in,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but a hero would give it to other\Npeople instead of eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My meat is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'll let you have\Nall the meat you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:03:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There will come a time\Nwhen I need your help
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll rush in when\Nthat moment arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get caught on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To get us close afterwards while their\Nattention's on me then one of you pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,will sneak out of megalo's\Nstomach and get yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,into position to make\Nyour attack did you see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a stomach the celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon's letter. They have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it we need it hold on\Nwhat's this letter jimba?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Luffy was sleeping\Nthrough most of your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In short,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the letter is something Queen Otohime\Nacquired ten years ago at great personal risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It will define the very\Nfuture of this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll also have the key we'll need\Nto release the king from his bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One of your crewmates must retrieve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you is up to the task?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good at stealing, but\Nstill, I think I'll need Robin's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've managed to\Nfree the king, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call Luffy and we'll take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After you emerge from Megalo's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the people of Fishman Island\Nwill understand your intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they'll see you and I working\Ntogether against the common foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, I must ask that you stay\Nsomewhere safe outside the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pass the letter to you, whereupon\Nthe entire royal family can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,During this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of you will have to head to Ryugu\NPalace to rescue your imprisoned friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're free, get to the plaza\Nto back us up as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As for how you go about saving them, well,\Nthat's for you to deal with. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Be specific!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on us big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we've got the Sonny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So no worries, we'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this is set in motion, there's\Nno turning back. We must succeed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone here respects Jimbae. Whether\Nthey're a civilian or outlaw, they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow after his example that's right.\NSo if they see Jimbae working with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,a human even a pirate they'll cheer\Nyou on or maybe even fight beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only doing this\Nbecause you asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that? I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Having people cheer for me? No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more for taking their\Nmoney and running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd go to the depths of hell if I knew the\Nmermaids would be there to cheer me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like everything is settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's up? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's our codename? Are\Nyou kidding? Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Skrya Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's human and a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed up right when Princess\NShirahoshi called for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,he's here to help Boss Team Bay\Nsave the country from Horty's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it sweet how they cling to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've only delayed the\Nking's inevitable demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you are nothing but a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your beauty outshines\Nall others, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we've met, would you be\Nwilling to show me your panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't ask her that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then show me yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No way in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all ignoring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just because I was\Nusing my inside voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy Swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've saved those idiots from\Nthe palace, you have to love me. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. He did what? Liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to the exit ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you never would have escaped\Nwithout me. That's a joke. Right, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your mom's letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how\Nmuch this means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it may look like an ordinary piece\Nof paper, but it's this island's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Whip Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't meant to be\Ncaught, so you must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, it was almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,my name, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a wuss, but more\Nthan just a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll call you Weepy Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When a person feels as if\Nthey've been wronged, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's only natural that\Nthey would turn to hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But you chose not to hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A coward wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardship has only made\Nyou stronger in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You endured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the thought, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I caused everyone trouble\Nby keeping this secret to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your intentions were pure, just\Nlike those who have come before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell them\Nyou have to hold it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, don't become angry on my behalf!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our heroes planted a seed in your\Nheart and it has blossomed beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have lived by their example.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if everyone else\Nthought the way you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,then there would be no\Nmore fighting and the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,conflict between fishmen\Nand humans would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,over at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have suffered through those\Npast years alone, but that doesn't make
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that time meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Single-handedly, you are a\Ndefender, protecting the virtues of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,others day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But today, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll protect them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:11:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You still cry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Strahd!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known Vander\NDecken was going to fail me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't even get rid\Nof one lousy princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power is too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is the stuff of legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I found out it was real I knew I had\Nto eliminate her as soon as possible. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, you got in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known\Nsomething was wrong when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you were captured without\Nputting up a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like these humans, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,People like you are the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've completely forgotten your pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you grew up with\NDock in our district.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's not forget Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He was like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them were beaten\Nor killed by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead of avenging them, you\Nwouldn't get in bed with the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, godless like Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon, everything is going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I'm king, that is. Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start with the world summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be the perfect place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,With every ruler in the surface world\Nin one place, they'll be easy to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the whole world will learn\Nto fear our underwater kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Their kingdoms in disarray\Nwill drag the humans
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,into the depths and\Nenslave every last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, there won't be a\Nsoul left to stand against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and we will rule the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, you pirates, we'll bow\Nthe same as everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These humans are more than capable of\Nholding their own, yet they kneel before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In a moment you'll be just like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think there are only ten\Nof you here to stand in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you possibly\Ndo when we're 100,000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,KILL THEM, NEW PIRATES!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we can fight this many at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the reason I don't\Nlike hanging out with you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Before this begins, it's been a\Npleasure traveling with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, if I try to count them\Nall, my eyes may pop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And again, I don't have eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So they can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just 100,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nothing we can't handle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just saying that because\Nyou're hiding behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Harbored Me! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this already! Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you can't count,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we're each gonna have to take down\N10,000 of these guys to win this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They have numbers, but it\Ndoesn't make them stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like they're\NNavy Admirals or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't crap yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After these guys, you're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 10,001. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those four million berries are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:14:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but he didn't do anything\Nand he still knocked them all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,out hey get up guys come on\Ndamn he took down half of us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,in an instant that was 50 000\Nof our men what did he even
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do did everyone see that? Yeah,\Nbut I don't know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so much power for one so young\Nwait did the Straw Hat guy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,really do that yeah too cool\Nthat Haki that training paid
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,off i see unreal i mean\Nconqueror's Haki scary sure is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but i'd expect no less otherwise\Nhe couldn't be my captain
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name's Heart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to become the king\Nof a country or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But king of the pirates? Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have lost 50,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But take heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.74,0:17:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have 50,000 left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those insufferable Straw Hat Pirates have\Nsought to shadow our dreams at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They must pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The traitor Jinbe is no better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He follows in Otohime's footsteps\Nand befriends the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is not the future\Nwe fishmen wish to create!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's a damn human!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell does he\Nknow about our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Anjibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wants to turn his back\Non his brothers, kill him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, you knocked out too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave some for me. Oh, yeah. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking 30,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, lost head?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, dirty cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.68,0:18:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His arm is I know it's huge. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick we had better assist him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is heaven for me I\Nwon't let you destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Still don't want to give\Nup. Well, more fun for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,me I was thinking this\Nisland is teeming with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Invaluable archaeological resources the way\Nyou're rampaging around and damaging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to be ashamed look at
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that crown they're ready to rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say a 50,000-man brawl is the perfect\Ntime to take them for a test drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Test drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say them? Them who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sonny just got two\Nbrand-new weapons. Big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys want to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You should keep an eye on your princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty big target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Water Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't need me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He deflected Captain Horty's water shot\Nwith his own, like it was nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so done with that big blue traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as much trouble as\NStraw Hats, maybe more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, that raw power of yours\Nis harnessed very poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fishman karate needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, I've heard\Nstories about this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the first fishman\Nto join the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and then after he resigned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,his bounty jumped up to\N400 million berries, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't win against that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fools stop\Nchattering and start fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you intend to kill the princess, you'll\Nhave to square with the rest of us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go forward, Iron Shell Squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Three swords time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shotsumaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he cut through their shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they were made out of cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They all drop like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this guy the Grim Reaper or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not doing work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sword hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryan, you're gonna get cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How long is this thing gonna last?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...until you get to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you idiots use your brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inflate your bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Pichiro Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, we'll stab you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Harrison Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Sea Urchin Spike Unit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the leader, Harrison Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you do anything else,\Ntake out the kicking guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.79,0:22:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seth... Paul!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you gonna do now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm\Nat a time like this? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, candy boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.42,0:22:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Over my dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought my favorite dress just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:23:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy. It's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Through thunder and\Nlightning, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cigar fires, you stubborn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just run away\Nfrom us forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.24,0:23:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these days, we're starting\Nto catch right up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten myself out of tougher\Nspots than this, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My courage had left me and\Nthere was nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.92,0:24:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.06,0:24:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.78,0:24:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a new path.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And then before long I.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.64,0:24:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Skywalk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.78,0:24:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji can walk on air now,\Nlike those other guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.54,0:24:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Skywalk. Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not moonwalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, scumbags!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.30,0:24:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.70,0:25:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got something to say to the\Nprincess, she'll have to go through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I just happen to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.44,0:25:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight in shining armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of wise guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.10,0:25:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's cook these small fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.10,0:25:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with! Already!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.78,0:25:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have a better idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How about instead, we leave the world's\Nmost lovely mermaid princess alone, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here's some party music!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd it get dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome all to this festival night!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.56,0:26:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, it was not a dream,\Nthat big fight we were having.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.54,0:26:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to set up the fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.62,0:26:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is much fun! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.58,0:26:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell are you guys aiming at?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.28,0:26:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.60,0:26:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're enjoying the festival too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.64,0:26:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.55,0:26:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Tortillas, Fantasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.12,0:27:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Neal, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.30,0:27:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantesco, mono!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.82,0:27:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.24,0:27:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.84,0:27:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of screaming going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that good or bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.26,0:27:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too cramped for\Nus all to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.84,0:27:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even interested\Nin the weapons anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.42,0:27:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I go outside,\NI'm going to have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.56,0:27:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be stuck out there either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.78,0:27:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, can we hurry\Nthis up a little, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.28,0:27:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rush greatness, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But fine, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm getting\Npretty excited now, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.62,0:28:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, but can you move?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to operate this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It got bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.68,0:28:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't it start out this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.96,0:28:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.16,0:28:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing\Nstoppin' this unveiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.31,0:28:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rock and roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.58,0:28:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him swatted in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.84,0:28:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how big\Nyour legs or arms are,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.18,0:28:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,cause you ain't gonna be nothin' but a\Ndead woman once we get our sneakers in ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than that case!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.30,0:28:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier. Dark Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.78,0:29:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Channel 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.56,0:29:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Arch Black Rhino.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.32,0:29:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's F.R.U. 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A motorbike! So cool! I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.70,0:29:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one tough machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And stylish too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.76,0:29:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see this venom of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.00,0:29:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can try stinging it\Nif you really want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.40,0:29:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But this monster's made of pure steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.84,0:30:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,On a scale of one to super!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.72,0:30:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone stop that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.56,0:30:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.66,0:30:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for steel on steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.30,0:30:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.67,0:30:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not scared, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The new number, Shadow 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.98,0:30:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Brachiotek 5 is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:30:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.54,0:31:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.00,0:31:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys see that perfect shot I made?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.10,0:31:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't think you're\Nusing this to its full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.62,0:31:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, and here I thought\NBrachio was just a shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.38,0:31:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention! Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.94,0:31:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Commander Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have enemy bogeys\Ninbound off our 9 o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.94,0:31:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you need a fight, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.76,0:31:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.26,0:31:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, they didn't look this tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.38,0:31:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only ten of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.74,0:31:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're taking on a hundred\Nthousand like it was nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.70,0:31:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, Timmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.60,0:32:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gone on too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.54,0:32:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise! My Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.12,0:32:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have ten targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the humans. Go!\NCrush them! You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:33:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how\Nstrong the Straw Hats are,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.68,0:33:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,they're all goners if they get\Nsmashed by those giant tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.44,0:33:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Kraken always does\Nwhatever Captain Ordy tells it to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.18,0:33:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's strong as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have a pair against\Nour deep-de-wrecking ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it's that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.14,0:33:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as I'm the one who dragged you\Nhere all the way from the North Pole,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.26,0:33:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes me your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.14,0:33:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So kill them already!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.30,0:33:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, can we talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.86,0:34:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Tsutome!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.90,0:34:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you can't see me down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.54,0:34:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my pet for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are buddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.18,0:34:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.90,0:34:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.96,0:34:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's people!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.76,0:34:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off, cinema!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.22,0:34:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.38,0:34:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.29,0:34:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.21,0:34:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.12,0:34:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.03,0:34:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.07,0:34:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon has betrayed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.79,0:34:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.58,0:34:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the occupants!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.14,0:35:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Crusher! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.04,0:35:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.84,0:35:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go that way, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.50,0:35:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's doing everything Straw Hat says!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.62,0:35:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.58,0:35:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Tsurume!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.30,0:35:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay here\Nand protect Weepy Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.22,0:35:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you managed to\Ningratiate yourself to the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.70,0:35:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems no matter where you go, you\Nalways befriend the highest caliber allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.30,0:35:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.28,0:35:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, thank you very much for\Nlending us your power, Sodom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.82,0:36:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a lot of these guys left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bring it on.
